WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.330
What could be the cause of this massive
mosquito outbreak this year?

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:06.950
We ask Mr. Kafetch,

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:08.990
a mosquito expert who has written
several books on the subject.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:10.970
Thank you for having me.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.990
Well, let me come right to the point.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:15.940
These mosquitos belong
to an entirely new species.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.040
Therefore, I know nothing about them.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:18.890
Get out of here!

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.480
Ahem, excuse me.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.770
Now, let's take a look at the areas

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.940
- likely to be hit hardest by the outbreak.

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.940
- Man, City Z's in their path.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.590
Now we've got a mosquito outbreak?

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:33.290
We interrupt this program
for breaking news.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:36.430
A large swarm of mosquitos
has been sighted in City Z.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.970
Mummified remains of attacked
farm animals have also been found.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:44.200
If you encounter a swarm of mosquitos,
flee immediately.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:38.650
This is an emergency evacuation warning.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:41.620
Threat level: Demon.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.940
No resident is to go outside
under any circumstances.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.980
